the family the way I was never able to.


01:31:04.626 --> 01:31:05.752
All right?


01:31:08.755 --> 01:31:09.923
You're a mama now.


01:31:11.424 --> 01:31:12.592
Okay?


01:31:16.012 --> 01:31:17.389
You need to care of your baby.


01:31:22.394 --> 01:31:25.814
